  "goodToKnow": "Der Kameramann (die Kamerafrau) is a camera operator or cinematographer; the plural is usually die Kameraleute, as with Kaufleute and Fachleute. German cinematographers like Michael Ballhaus, who worked with Fassbinder and Scorsese, became world-famous. Die Kamera is a camera, pronounced KA-me-ra. A more gender-neutral term is Bildgestalter. Plural: die Kameraleute."
